# geography.kb — countries with their capitals and currencies, the physical features a general
# education names, and the terms that describe them.
#
# ``capital``, ``currency`` and ``located_in`` are functional here: one value each, enforced by
# the parser. That is the whole reason this file can carry capitals at all where
# ``prepare_conceptnet.py`` had to drop ``/r/AtLocation`` — a hand-written source can promise
# uniqueness and be checked on it.

# --- terms ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
geography | is_a=discipline | involves=places | involves=landscapes | involves=people | has_kind=physical geography | has_kind=human geography
continent | is_a=large landmass | has_kind=Africa | has_kind=Antarctica | has_kind=Asia | has_kind=Europe | has_kind=North America | has_kind=Oceania | has_kind=South America
country | is_a=political territory | has_part=government | has_part=border | has_part=population
capital city | is_a=city | purpose=seating the government of a country
equator | is_a=line of latitude | has_property=zero degrees | purpose=dividing the earth into hemispheres
latitude | is_a=coordinate | means=the angular distance north or south of the equator | unit=degree
longitude | is_a=coordinate | means=the angular distance east or west of the prime meridian | unit=degree
prime meridian | is_a=line of longitude | located_in=Greenwich | has_property=zero degrees
time zone | is_a=region | purpose=keeping a common clock time | requires=the earth's rotation
desert | is_a=biome | has_property=very low rainfall | has_kind=Sahara | has_kind=Gobi | has_kind=Atacama
rainforest | is_a=biome | has_property=high rainfall | has_property=very high biodiversity | has_kind=Amazon rainforest
tundra | is_a=biome | has_property=cold | has_property=treeless | has_property=frozen subsoil
savanna | is_a=biome | has_property=grassland with scattered trees | located_in=the tropics
island | is_a=landform | has_property=surrounded by water
peninsula | is_a=landform | has_property=surrounded by water on three sides
valley | is_a=landform | occurs_when=a river or glacier erodes a channel
plateau | is_a=landform | has_property=raised | has_property=flat topped
urbanisation | is_a=social process | means=the growth of the share of people living in cities | causes=pressure on housing | causes=pressure on transport
population density | is_a=measure | means=the number of people per unit area

