Germany | is_a=country | located_in=Central Europe | capital=Berlin | currency=the euro | has_part=the Rhine
Italy | is_a=country | located_in=Southern Europe | capital=Rome | currency=the euro | has_part=the Alps | has_part=Sicily
Spain | is_a=country | located_in=Southern Europe | capital=Madrid | currency=the euro
Russia | is_a=country | located_in=Eastern Europe and North Asia | capital=Moscow | currency=the rouble | has_property=the largest country by area | has_part=Siberia
