Egypt | is_a=country | located_in=North Africa | capital=Cairo | currency=the Egyptian pound | has_part=the Nile | has_part=the Pyramids of Giza
Nigeria | is_a=country | located_in=West Africa | capital=Abuja | currency=the naira | has_property=the most populous country in Africa
South Africa | is_a=country | located_in=Southern Africa | capital=Pretoria | currency=the rand
Kenya | is_a=country | located_in=East Africa | capital=Nairobi | currency=the Kenyan shilling
Ethiopia | is_a=country | located_in=East Africa | capital=Addis Ababa | currency=the birr
