Tanzania | is_a=country | located_in=East Africa | capital=Dodoma | currency=the Tanzanian shilling | has_part=Mount Kilimanjaro

# --- the Americas and Oceania --------------------------------------------------------------------------#
United States | is_a=country | located_in=North America | capital=Washington DC | currency=the US dollar | has_part=the Mississippi | has_part=the Rocky Mountains | has_part=Alaska
Canada | is_a=country | located_in=North America | capital=Ottawa | currency=the Canadian dollar | has_property=the second largest country by area
Mexico | is_a=country | located_in=North America | capital=Mexico City | currency=the Mexican peso
Brazil | is_a=country | located_in=South America | capital=Brasilia | currency=the real | has_part=the Amazon rainforest | has_property=the largest country in South America
Argentina | is_a=country | located_in=South America | capital=Buenos Aires | currency=the Argentine peso | has_part=Patagonia
Chile | is_a=country | located_in=South America | capital=Santiago | currency=the Chilean peso | has_part=the Atacama
Peru | is_a=country | located_in=South America | capital=Lima | currency=the sol | has_part=Machu Picchu
Colombia | is_a=country | located_in=South America | capital=Bogota | currency=the Colombian peso
Australia | is_a=country | located_in=Oceania | capital=Canberra | currency=the Australian dollar | has_part=the Great Barrier Reef | has_part=the Outback
New Zealand | is_a=island country | located_in=Oceania | capital=Wellington | currency=the New Zealand dollar

# --- physical features ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
Mount Everest | is_a=mountain | located_in=the Himalayas | has_property=the highest point on earth | has_property=about eight thousand eight hundred and forty nine metres
Himalayas | is_a=mountain range | located_in=Asia | has_part=Mount Everest | has_part=K2
Alps | is_a=mountain range | located_in=Europe | has_part=Mont Blanc
Andes | is_a=mountain range | located_in=South America | has_property=the longest continental mountain range
Rocky Mountains | is_a=mountain range | located_in=North America
Sahara | is_a=desert | located_in=North Africa | has_property=the largest hot desert
Nile | is_a=river | located_in=Africa | has_property=among the longest rivers in the world | causes=fertile land along its banks
Amazon River | is_a=river | located_in=South America | has_property=the greatest discharge of any river
Ganges | is_a=river | located_in=India | has_property=sacred in Hinduism
Yangtze | is_a=river | located_in=China | has_property=the longest river in Asia
Mississippi | is_a=river | located_in=the United States
Pacific Ocean | is_a=ocean | has_property=the largest ocean | has_part=the Mariana Trench
Atlantic Ocean | is_a=ocean | has_property=the second largest ocean
Indian Ocean | is_a=ocean | located_in=between Africa, Asia and Australia
Arctic Ocean | is_a=ocean | has_property=the smallest and shallowest ocean | has_property=covered by sea ice
Mariana Trench | is_a=ocean trench | located_in=the Pacific Ocean | has_property=the deepest point in the ocean
Great Barrier Reef | is_a=coral reef | located_in=Australia | has_property=the largest coral reef system | has_property=threatened by warming seas
Amazon Rainforest | is_a=rainforest | located_in=South America | has_property=the largest tropical rainforest | purpose=absorbing carbon dioxide
Antarctica | is_a=continent | has_property=the coldest continent | has_property=covered by an ice sheet | has_property=no permanent population
